1. Rebuild locally
From your project folder:

bash
docker build -t lazyleech-lazyleech:latest .
This creates a fresh image from your latest code.

2. Tag for ACR
bash
docker tag lazyleech-lazyleech:latest denhjikareg.azurecr.io/lazyleech-lazyleech:latest
Tagging is required so Docker knows which registry to push to.

3. Push to ACR
bash
docker push denhjikareg.azurecr.io/lazyleech-lazyleech:latest